@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Asignar Experiencia Profesional (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professional-experience
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaExpertiseId": "AREA_EXPERTISE_UUID_HERE",
  "categoryId": "CATEGORY_UUID_HERE"
}

### Actualizar Experiencia Profesional (Alumno propietario)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/professional-experience/EXPERIENCE_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaExpertiseId": "NEW_AREA_EXPERTISE_UUID_HERE"
}

### Eliminar Experiencia Profesional (Alumno propietario)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/professional-experience/EXPERIENCE_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Analizar Experiencia con IA (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/professional-experience/analyze
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Trabajé como desarrollador de backend con Node.js y bases de datos relacionales durante dos años."
}
